OL,3,GNEWSAIllegal e-bikes crushed in police
OL,4,Acrackdown
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of unregistered motorbikes and
OL,7,Fillegal e-scooters and e-bikes have
OL,8,Fbeen crushed as part of a police
OL,9,Fcrackdown.
OL,11,FOperation Scramble saw police forces in
OL,12,FSussex and Surrey seize a large number
OL,13,Fof the illegal vehicles amid growing
OL,14,Fconcerns about public safety.
OL,16,FSussex Police and Crime Commissioner
OL,17,F(PCC) Katy Bourne visited Silverlake
OL,18,FGarage near Southampton, Hampshire, to
OL,19,Fsee them destroyed and sent off for
OL,20,Frecycling.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
